  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "社會創新與設計思考",
    "sub_ename": "SOCIAL INNOVATION AND DESIGN THINKING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程希望透過社會創新及設計思考，培養學生具備主動學習與分析議題的習慣、透過創意思考與?同專業背景進行團隊合作、運用科技及商業模式解決複雜問題的能力，以面對未來真實社會的競爭。",
    "describe_eh": "Through social innovation and design thinking procedures, this course guides students how to be actively learning and systematic thinking, teamwork through creative thinking with different professional backgrounds, and to use new technology and business models to solve complex problems, in order to face the real competition in the future.",
